    - target: {fileID: 5633951855702518726, guid: ae5f7a3ea3ee4e14a8cf94a456e102ca, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Treelane Residences is a townhouse development located in Brgy. Bucandala,
        Imus, Cavite. Designed for growing families, the community offers convenient
        access to schools, shopping malls, leisure destinations, and major business
        hubs in the South and Metro Manila.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
